# Clean code

- Names say what and why (`isSessionExpired`, not `flag2`). Types over comments. Do not comment what the code already shows.
- One component / function / store action, one job. If it needs “and” in the name, split it.
- Feature isolation: other features import only from `features/<name>/index.ts`. No deep imports into another feature’s files.
- Put code in `shared/` only after a second feature needs it. Do not abstract on first use.
- Keep nesting shallow. Prefer early returns over else-pyramids.
- Handle errors where you can do something useful; do not empty `catch`.
- Delete dead code. Do not leave unused props, routes, or commented-out blocks.
- Match existing style. No drive-by refactors outside the current chunk.
